      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOUSE OF SINS (8) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 660m at Bendigo, taking a Mix 4/5 FIN in an excellent 37.68. Looks the one to beat on win two back. NO STOP SIGNS (3) goes very well this trip starting 11 times for four wins and two minors. Placed last time (34.90) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 7 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. HURRICANE (4) has a big motor and ideally suited at the longer trips. Kept coming to finish sixth over 515m at this track (30.17) latest in a Mix 4/5 FIN but is better placed by the extra ground now. Has never been out of the money in six starts this distance. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. One of the better chances. PAW IOWA (2) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
